    localizationKey: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.principle
    sourceText: Ahem... yes. The principle behind our translator is simple.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.35
    situation: 
    beforeAction: 
    afterAction: 
    stageDirection: 
    tags: []
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD760\uD760\u2026\uC608. \uC800\uD76C \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30\uC758 \uC6D0\uB9AC\uB294
        \uAC04\uB2E8\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: briefing_fft_0090
    sectionId: facility_briefing
    order: 120
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: BriefingProjectorTechnical
    triggerEvent: intro.facility.briefing
    condition: 
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: DR. HWANG
    localizationKey: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.fft
    sourceText: First, a multichannel phased-array receiver simultaneously samples
      the neuroelectromagnetic signals emitted extracranially by an alien subject.
      We then apply a fast Fourier transform to the time-domain evoked-potential
      waveform and decompose it into a frequency spectrum.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.35
    situation: 
    beforeAction: 
    afterAction: 
    stageDirection: 
    tags: []
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6B0\uC120 \uC678\uACC4 \uAC1C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uB450\uAC1C\uC678\uB85C
        \uBC29\uC0AC\uD558\uB294 \uC2E0\uACBD\uC804\uC790\uAE30 \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C
        \uB2E4\uCC44\uB110 \uC704\uC0C1\uBC30\uC5F4 \uC218\uC2E0\uAE30\uB85C \uB3D9\uC2DC
        \uD45C\uBCF8\uD654\uD55C \uB4A4, \uC720\uBC1C\uC804\uC704\uC758 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC601\uC5ED
        \uD30C\uD615\uC5D0 \uACE0\uC18D \uD478\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uBCC0\uD658\uC744 \uC801\uC6A9\uD558\uC5EC
        \uC8FC\uD30C\uC218\uBCC4 \uC2A4\uD399\uD2B8\uB7FC\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uD574\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: briefing_feature_vector_0091
    sectionId: facility_briefing
    order: 130
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: BriefingProjectorTechnical
    triggerEvent: intro.facility.briefing
    condition: 
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: DR. HWANG
    localizationKey: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.feature_vector
    sourceText: Next, an adaptive band-pass filter removes baseline drift and physiological
      noise. Phase delay, amplitude-modulation rate, and harmonic distribution are
      normalized and reconstructed as a multidimensional feature vector.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.35
    situation: 
    beforeAction: 
    afterAction: 
    stageDirection: 
    tags: []
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB2E4\uC74C \uAE30\uC800\uC120 \uD3B8\uCC28\uC640 \uC0DD\uB9AC\uC801
        \uC7A1\uC74C\uC744 \uC801\uC751\uD615 \uB300\uC5ED\uD1B5\uACFC \uD544\uD130\uB85C
        \uC81C\uAC70\uD558\uACE0, \uC704\uC0C1 \uC9C0\uC5F0\uAC12\uACFC \uC9C4\uD3ED
        \uBCC0\uC870\uC728, \uACE0\uC870\uD30C \uBD84\uD3EC\uB97C \uC815\uADDC\uD654\uD558\uC5EC
        \uB2E4\uCC28\uC6D0 \uD2B9\uC9D5 \uBCA1\uD130\uB85C \uC7AC\uAD6C\uC131\uD558\uC9C0\uC694."
      status: final
  - id: briefing_mahalanobis_0092
    sectionId: facility_briefing
    order: 140
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: BriefingProjectorTechnical
    triggerEvent: intro.facility.briefing
    condition: 
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: DR. HWANG
    localizationKey: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.mahalanobis
    sourceText: "We feed that vector into a stimulus-specific cross-correlation matrix
      and combine multivariate discriminant analysis with non-hierarchical clustering
      to estimate semantic proximity between waveforms. When an unknown signal arrives,
      a Bayesian estimator calculates its posterior probability and the Mahalanobis
      distance to the existing semantic groups\u2014"
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.35
    situation: 
    beforeAction: 
    afterAction: 
    stageDirection: 
    tags: []
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uD2B9\uC9D5 \uBCA1\uD130\uB97C \uC790\uADF9\uBB3C\uBCC4 \uAD50\uCC28\uC0C1\uAD00
        \uD589\uB82C\uC5D0 \uB300\uC785\uD558\uACE0, \uB2E4\uBCC0\uB7C9 \uD310\uBCC4\uBD84\uC11D\uACFC
        \uBE44\uACC4\uCE35\uC801 \uAD70\uC9D1\uD654\uB97C \uBCD1\uD589\uD558\uBA74
        \uAC1C\uBCC4 \uD30C\uD615 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758 \uC758\uBBF8\uB860\uC801 \uADFC\uC811\uB3C4\uB97C
        \uCD94\uC815\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC774\uD6C4 \uBBF8\uC9C0
        \uC2E0\uD638\uAC00 \uC218\uC2E0\uB418\uBA74 \uBCA0\uC774\uC988 \uCD94\uC815\uAE30\uB97C
        \uD1B5\uD574 \uC0AC\uD6C4\uD655\uB960\uC744 \uC0B0\uCD9C\uD558\uACE0 \uAE30\uC874
        \uC758\uBBF8\uAD70\uACFC\uC758 \uB9C8\uD560\uB77C\uB178\uBE44\uC2A4 \uAC70\uB9AC\uB97C\u2014"
      status: final
